WEBVTT

00:06:00.807 --> 00:06:02.624
Huu ni kosa.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.167
Martin Luther King Jr alielezea mbona.

00:06:07.355 --> 00:06:11.117
Kwa kutafakari mgomo
wa wasafishaji mazingira

00:06:11.141 --> 00:06:13.142
uko Memphis, Tennessee,

00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:15.166
muda mfupi kabla hajawawa,

00:06:16.097 --> 00:06:17.684
King alisema,

00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:22.732
"Mtu anyezoa takataka,
kwa uchambuzi wa kina,

00:06:22.756 --> 00:06:25.438
ana umuhimu sawa na daktari,

00:06:26.855 --> 00:06:29.085
asipofanya kazi yake,

00:06:29.109 --> 00:06:31.109
magonjwa yanakithiri.